on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [  5] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] add ..................................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [  9] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 11] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0) + 1)
  [ 13] ret
end
